  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three clients",
      "items": [
        "Hermes runs the Python CLI detached (--bg) in its container",
        "ZCode Mode A launches the engine and answers its stdio requests: the window is the model",
        "Claude Code runs the JS twin inside its Workflow runtime, no Python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Framing, plan, sweep, deepen, rank, 3-lens panel (2 refutes kill)",
        "Rescue, blind citation audit with restate-or-drop, synthesis, critic",
        "Every model call goes through engine.agent(): HTTP, a spawned harness, or stdio"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Shared contract",
      "items": [
        "The engine reads tiers, depths, hypothesis words and conformance; the seam reads providers",
        "tools/sync_tiers.py generates JS copies of tiers, depths and hypothesis words",
        "conformance.json asks both builds its 12 shared cases; 9 more are Python-only"
      ]
    }
  ]
